OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in the south
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, turning heavy
OL,7,Fat times. Gradually turning drier
OL,8,Fthrough the day with some warm spells
OL,9,Fpossible. Brighter in the north with
OL,10,Fsome prolonged sunny spells and
OL,11,Ffeeling fresh.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying cloudy and mild in
OL,14,Fthe south tonight with a few spots of
OL,15,Flight rain possible. A fresher feel in
OL,16,Fthe north with clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
