OL,5,CMonday:FWarm and humid in the south
OL,6,Fwith cloudy skies, although some
OL,7,Fbrighter spells are possible. A dry
OL,8,Fstart in the north, before heavy rain
OL,9,Fmoves into Northern Ireland and
OL,10,FScotland.
